  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sphere of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and positive charge q is at rest midway between two horizontal parallel plates separated by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>. The potential difference across the plates is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is q?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{s}{mgV}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{V}{mgs}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgV}{s}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgs}{V}\"></span></li></ol>"
